  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "The sources are an About Us page and a fall office menu from Salvia Kitchen, a catering business run by Ana and her brother Tomas.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_255660322b8a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_255660322b8a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P3",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Last year they catered 214 events and served about 9,600 guests, mostly office lunches and baby showers.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_255660322b8a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Boxed lunches cost $16 per person with a 10-box minimum, and family-style trays cost $24 per person for at least 15 guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Orders need 72 hours notice, and delivery is free within 10 miles of downtown but costs $35 beyond that.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Every menu can be made gluten-free on request, and all eight major allergens are labeled.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "Family-style trays cost $24 per person, $8 more than the $16 boxed lunch. Since office lunches are most of the business, which format do offices order more often?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P5",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_255660322b8a"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "The kitchen handled 214 events last year but needs 72 hours notice for every order. How often do clients ask for food on shorter notice than that?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "About us",
            "locator": "para. 2",
            "source_id": "s_255660322b8a"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Fall menu",
            "locator": "para. 5",
            "source_id": "s_28be7d52e89d"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
    ],
